# Trivy waivers — findings accepted instead of fixed.
#
# Policy: an entry here means the finding was triaged, accepted, and is
# re-reviewed each release. Every waiver carries the date it was accepted,
# the reason, and a next-review date; drop the line once a fix ships
# upstream. Nothing enters this file without all three.
#
# Format — one finding per line, with a comment line above it:
#
#   # accepted YYYY-MM-DD — <reason> — next review YYYY-MM-DD
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN
#
# (Empty — no accepted findings.)
